      "content": "English: Lilith | French: Lilith | Latin: Lamia | Origin: &#1500;&#1468;&#1460;&#1497;&#1500;&#1460;&#1497;&#1514; | Vietnamese: Li-lít -- Is 34,14",
      "kind": "MARK_KIND_FOOTNOTE",
      "label": "21",
      "sortOrder": 20,
      "startOffset": 39,
